Objective Brief
Revamp Cosmic Council’s Companions module from generic category matching into a deeply personal, emotionally resonant companion platform—while introducing a unified 5 Chat Styles rendering system across both Councils and Companions, completely manageable from /app/admin with zero code changes.
Core Behavioral & Architectural Goals:
19 Named Preset Companions + "Find someone new" (last option): Preserve the 13 original companion prompt architectures verbatim while replacing bot-like prefixes with natural human names balanced across India, US, and Spanish-speaking audiences (Aira, Kira, Camila, Mira, Elia, Max, Tara, Sofia, Luna, Marc, Bella, Kai, Anya), plus 6 complementary companions (Kabir, Mateo, Dev, Leo, Valeria, Rohan) and natural bilingual/code-switching fluency (English, Spanish/Spanglish, Hindi/Hinglish).
Per-(User × Companion) Shared Memory & Strict Cross-Isolation: All threads with the same companion share longitudinal memory, cross-thread awareness, and invisible relationship evolution (gradual mirroring of slang/tone over time), while strictly isolating context across different companions and between Companions and Council.
Quiet Chart Access, 90/10 Esoteric Restraint & Warm Referrals: Every companion has read access to the user’s default ("You") profile/chart (and optional per-thread chart switching), never asking for birth details if attached, never bringing up astrology unprompted unless skilled + relevant, and warmly referring out-of-skill requests to the right companion via one-tap "Walk over together" handoff cards.
Hard Rules vs. Soft Rules + Human Realism: Split rules into non-negotiable Hard Rules and overrideable Soft Rules ("Default Instincts") where individual companion rules always override global rules; inject local time-of-day, time-gap since last reply, contextual return greetings, adaptive reply length, occasional multi-bubble texting with live "Name is typing…" pauses, bubble reactions, and distinct TTS voice-note pacing.
5 Admin-Selectable Chat Styles (Councils + Companions): editorial, structured, chat_bubbles, dialogue, and concise_brief—selectable per Council guide and per Companion in Admin.
Editorial Illustrated DPs & Zero-Code Admin Control: Custom editorial watercolor/gouache portraits (with symbolic monogram fallback) and full CRUD management in /app/admin (including per-companion AI Model, Chat Style, Hard/Soft rules, DPs, and live preview).
