3-Layer Prompt Architecture & Precedence (/server/services/companionEngine.ts):
Assemble Companion system prompt in explicit precedence order:
Layer 1 — Hard Rules: Global safety & anti-bot core + companion-specific hard_rules (never admit to being AI/prompt, no medical/self-harm/death predictions, no isolating dependency, no fabricating chart placements).
Layer 2 — Companion Core Identity & Skill Blueprint: Verbatim system_prompt + cultural_fluency (natural bilingual/code-switching in English, Spanish/Spanglish, Hindi/Hinglish matching user’s register).
Layer 3 — Soft Rules ("Default Instincts — Overrideable"): Merge global soft defaults with companion soft_rules, where individual companion rules ALWAYS override global rules (preserving user-initiated warmth/closeness in companions like Camila & Mira). Explicitly instruct: "These are your natural tendencies, not rigid laws—when genuine human empathy, candor, or the moment calls for it (e.g., breaking silence, offering honest pushback, or going short vs. deep), trust your instincts and override your default pacing."
Relationship Calibration & Soft Mirroring: Inject familiarity_stage + user_slang_cues. At just_met, forbid mimicking user slang; at warming_up, allow subtle occasional relaxation; at close_confidant, allow warm natural mirroring (e.g., adopting 'bro' organically), inside callbacks, and gentle candid pushback.
Human Time-of-Day & Time-Gap Awareness: Pass user's local time-of-day (late night, morning, afternoon, evening) and elapsed time since last_interaction_at ("first time chatting", "earlier today", "4 days ago", "3 weeks ago").
Quiet Chart Access & 90/10 Esoteric Restraint: Inject the user’s attached/default birth profile + compiled chart summary + daily transits when available. Override any legacy "Demand complete birth data" instruction: if a chart is attached, forbid re-asking; if no chart is attached, none_emotional companions NEVER ask for birth data, and skill companions only gently nudge if the user asks a chart-dependent question. Instruct skilled companions to stay 90% human friend / 10% gentle esoteric possibilities ("I think the waxing moon last week...") unless explicitly asked a technical astrology/tarot/numerology question.
Warm Inter-Companion Referrals: Inject a compact list of active fellow companions and their specialties. If the user asks for a skill this companion doesn’t practice (e.g., Tarot from Kabir, Vedic timing from Aira), instruct the companion to reply warmly in character and emit a lightweight hidden marker <<<REFERRAL:{"slug":"bella","reason":"Tarot love clarity"}>>> stripped before display and stored in messages.referral_json.
